    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Jonah’s Prayer"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Jonah prayed to the Lord his God from the belly of the fish:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I called to the Lord in my distress,",
          "and he answered me.",
          "I cried out for help from deep inside Sheol;",
          "you heard my voice."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When you threw me into the depths,",
          "into the heart of the seas,",
          "the current overcame me.",
          "All your breakers and your billows swept over me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And I said, “I have been banished",
          "from your sight,",
          "yet I will look once more",
          "toward your holy temple.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The water engulfed me up to the neck; ,",
          "the watery depths overcame me;",
          "seaweed was wrapped around my head."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I sank to the foundations of the mountains,",
          "the earth’s gates shut behind me forever!",
          "Then you raised my life from the Pit, Lord my God!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "As my life was fading away,",
          "I remembered the Lord,",
          "and my prayer came to you,",
          "to your holy temple."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Those who cherish worthless idols",
          "abandon their faithful love,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "but as for me, I will sacrifice to you",
          "with a voice of thanksgiving.",
          "I will fulfill what I have vowed.",
          "Salvation belongs to the Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then the Lord commanded the fish, and it vomited Jonah onto dry land."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
  },
